1. Historical Role-Play (20 minutes)
* Divide students into small groups and assign each group a historical figure or event related to the Opium Wars.
* Have each group create a short skit or scene that depicts their assigned figure or event.
* Encourage students to use drama and mime techniques to convey their message.
1. Debrief (10 minutes)
* Have each group present their skit and lead a class discussion on the causes and effects of the Opium Wars.

Day 2:

1. Review (10 minutes)
